+	 * pimSetUseMsiExec(), which an explicit USE_MSIEXEC XML property can
+	 * override. Constructs and Execute()s a pimMSILoop asynchronously.
+	 * @return true if the gate was acquired and the install started; false if busy.
+	 */
 	int MSICopy_low(pimXmlFile *);
 
